      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "40",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Josefu kutambua ndodo ra wafungwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyuma ya maza iro, m'baa wa wadumiki wenyosha divei na m'baa wa waochi mikate, wikamkosera bwana wawo mzuri wa Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mzuri ukazamilwa ni awo wabaa wa kazi wake wawi, m'baa wa wadumiki wenyosha divei, na m'baa wa waochi mikate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao ukawingira kifungonyi nyumbenyi kwa m'baa wa walindiri andu Josefu orekoghe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wikakaia kifungonyi kwa ngelo ndacha, na m'baa wa walindiri ukammbika Josefu uwidumikieghe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao kio chimu aho kifungonyi, uja mdumiki onyosha divei na uja muochi mikate wikaloda ndodo kula mundu yake, na kutambua kwaro wuzima wuzima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata iji Josefu orechieghe kwawo nakesho ukawiwona wiko na wasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukawikotia awo wabaa wa wadumiki wa mzuri, awo werekwanyeghe kifungonyi nyumbenyi kwa bwana wake, “Kwaki mwakaia na wasi huwu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawo wikamzera, “Deeloda ndodo, naro ndekuwadie mndungi odima kuritambua anduangi.” Josefu ukawizera, “Kutambua kose ndakwadafuma kwa Mlungu. Namlomba munighorie ndodo renyu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao uja m'baa wa wadumiki wenyosha divei ukamzera, “Nerewonieghe ndodonyi kwapo mzabibu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nagho ghorekoghe na mbashu idadu, nao riendafunya malemba, shwa wori rikafunya mboi na vanga varo vikawuya zabibu riwurue. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nani nerekoghe niwadie kikombe cha mzuri, ngawaya iro zabibu na kurikama andenyi ya icho kikombe cha mzuri, ngamneka mkonunyi kwake.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao Josefu ukaghamba, “Kutambua kwaro niko uku: Iro mbashu idadu ni matuku adadu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyuma ya matuku adadu mzuri uchakufungua na kukuwunja kazinyi kwako; na oho kuchamneka mzuri kikombe mkonunyi kwake, sa iji koni korekoghe imbiri iji korekoghe mnyoshi divei wake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela nakulomba kunikumbuke iji maza rako rakaia nicha, kunighore kwa mzuri, eri unifunye ihi nyumba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu kwa loli ini nedeiwa kufuma isanga ja Waebrania, na hata aha sibonyere ikosa jingi jenibonya ningiro kifungonyi anduangi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao iji m'baa wa waochi mikate orewonieghe seji kutambushira korekoghe kuboie, ukamghoria Josefu ndodo yake ukighamba, “Hata ini wori nerelodieghe huwu: Naduka vikapu vidadu va mikate chongonyi kwapo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na chija kikapu cha ighu cherekoghe na vindo va kula mbari viochelo nicha va mzuri, ela nyonyi rerekoghe rikivija a kikapunyi chongonyi kwapo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Josefu ukatumbulia, “Uku niko kutambua kwaro: Ivo vikapu vidadu ni matuku adadu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyuma ya matuku adadu mzuri uchakufungua, nao uchachidumbua chongo chako na kukuwanika mudinyi, na nyonyi richaja nyama ya mumbi ghwako.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao ituku ja kadadu mzuri orebonyereghe karamu ya kuvalwa kwake, ukawikaribisha wadumiki wake wose. Nao ukawifungua wadumiki wake, m'baa wa wanyoshi divei, na m'baa wa waochi mikate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukammbunja m'baa wa wanyoshi divei kazinyi kwake, nao ukamneka mzuri kikombe mkonunyi kwake; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ela ukammbanika mudinyi uja m'baa wa waochi mikate sa iji koni Josefu orewitambushireghe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela uja m'baa wa wanyoshi divei nderemkumbukieghe Josefu anduangi; oochamliwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
